# Fork docs (pointer)

**Read and follow** the IDE-agnostic documentation hub:

1. `local-runtime/docs/README.md` — index
2. `local-runtime/docs/guide/rules.md` — placement policy (Core vs extension)
3. Guides under `local-runtime/docs/guide/` as needed for the task
4. `local-runtime/docs/CHANGELOG-LOOM-FORK.md` when changing Loom core paths

Do **not** copy policy or how-to into this file. If this note and
`local-runtime/docs/` disagree, **the docs win**.

**Hard gate:** do not edit Loom core paths without an explicit Dev approval
after stating reasons (see `guide/rules.md`). Do not refactor unless the Dev
asks; log opportunities in `local-runtime/docs/backlog/refactoring.md`.
Update `guide/architecture.md` when containers, auth flows, or data stores change.
